# Shows the values of all instance variables — runs the "Open Values List..." command INSIDE the instance.
# Attention: self-modifying code !!!
Calculate methodtext as con('Variable menu command: Open Values List... ',pVariableName)
Do $cinst.$cloneMethodToAndExecute(methodtext.$ref,pInstance.$class().$ref,pInstance.$ref,,pVariableName) ## @SELF
Quit method